WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Our first guest tonight
is an Emmy-nominated

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Golden Globe
award-winning actress

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:04.938 line:92%
for her work on "Black-ish."

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:08.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
The season finale
airs May 18th on ABC.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.009 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's take a look.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:12.379 size:88% position:44%
-Diane, as the driver,
what do you do to start?

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:15.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Address mirrors, start engine
hands and 10:00 and 2:00.

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:18.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
One lap around, stay alert
then park safely

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:21.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
next to strategically placed
safety trash cans.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ooh!
-Okay.

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:23.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
Girl, you ready.
-Yes.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, listen.
You're gonna make mistakes

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:27.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right?
You're gonna get frustrated.

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:28.895 line:92%
But I am here to guide you

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
And also, I'm gonna have
a little bit of fun,

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:32.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause this is
your first time because --

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:33.833 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Engine starts ]

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:37.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Clears throat ]
Have you...driven before?

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:38.304 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Not that you can prove.

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:39.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Chuckles nervously ]
Okay.

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:40.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Please welcome back
to the show,

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
our friend, Tracee Ellis Ross.
How are you, Tracee?

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:46.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hi, Seth.
How you doing?

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:48.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm doing wonderful.
I last saw you in August.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:50.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
And really hoped the next time
we'd see each other,

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:52.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
it would be in person,
and yet here we are again.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:55.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
Although I do think
you're in a different room

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think
I'm in a different room.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.060 line:92%
But I'm still in the same house.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.362 line:92%
I'm still in the same place.

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:05.832
But, yeah, I was hoping I woul
be there with you in person.

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:07.000 line:92%
But we have made progress.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's light
at the end of the tunnel.

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:13.473
I feel the vaccination hop
just wafting through the air

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I feel the same
sort of optimism.

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:16.876 line:92%
And I do think it's bringing u

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
closer to seeing each othe
in the same room.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
Speaking of rooms, true story,
does your --

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:24.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
your house
has a meditation room?

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:27.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
-My house
used to have a meditation room

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:27.687 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, what happened?

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:32.125
-Well, it became the one roo
in the house that had, like,

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:35.028 size:81% position:41%
doors on either side
for cross ventilation,

00:01:35.028 --> 00:01:40.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I would put fans, air
purifier, open all the doors

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:42.402 size:81% position:41%
and if I needed anyone
to come to the house,

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:45.738
that's where we would sit
if we couldn't be outside.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Got you.
-So my meditation room

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.110 size:81% position:41%
is now my whole house.
And now I just have --

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:54.681
I have to be, Seth, in a walking
meditation at all times.

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:56.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, right.
Sure.

00:01:56.216 --> 00:01:56.783 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Do you know?

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:59.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just have to practice
being present at all times

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:03.656 size:88% position:44%
-Now, I feel like I read
that it was a boom time

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:07.393
this whole quarantine year
for people and meditating.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:10.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
But as someone who meditated
before COVID hit,

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:13.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
did you find it was a good yea
for you in meditating?

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:16.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, it was really hard
for me to sit.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:18.872 line:92%
I'm a sitting meditation gal

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:22.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I couldn't
quiet my mind enough.

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:24.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think I was in --
I mean, I realized

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:27.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
once I got the vaccination
that I was afraid --

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:28.548 line:92%
like, terrified for a year

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.817 align:start size:94% position:6%
My nervous system,
my lower brain stem.

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:32.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was in fight or flight
for a year.

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:34.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I couldn't
settle myself down enough

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:36.656 align:start size:94% position:6%
to sit on my cushions.
But I did a lot of

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:40.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
moving meditation
and breathing work,

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:41.594 size:81% position:41% line:92%
which was good enough.

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:46.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have since been able
to sit in meditation again

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:48.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Were you emotional
when you got your vaccine?

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:50.703 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I was emotional.

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:55.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
I felt a deep sense
of relief and gratitude.

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:58.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
I also kept --
I said this little prayer.

00:02:58.178 --> 00:03:03.683
It was, "Thank you, science,
for stepping in and allowing m

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:08.922
to put down my rudimentary tools
to face this terrifying monster,

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:12.659
of locking myself in my hous
and being afraid of people."

00:03:12.659 --> 00:03:14.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was so happy
to drop that mantle.

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:16.963
It has taken me time, 'cause
like, I don't know about you

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:19.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
but my experience is,
the little things that I d

00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:22.936
out in the world, I think
I'm fine with my mask on.

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:26.139
And then I come home, and I'
in, like, a tailspin of anxiety,

00:03:26.139 --> 00:03:28.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm convinced
that I've gotten COVID,

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:30.843 align:start size:94% position:6%
which reminds me of
the beginning of the pandemic,

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:34.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
when, like, every sensation of
your body, you were like -

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.248 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Panting ]

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:38.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
But slowly creeping --
gently creeping my way forward

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:41.721 size:84% position:42%
But, yeah, a deep sense
of gratitude and tears.

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:42.322 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What about you?

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:45.258
-Oh, yeah, I got super choked up
when I got my first shot.

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:47.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was --
And it definitely surprised me

00:03:47.393 --> 00:03:50.463
But I think I had the same thing
of I did not realize

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:55.301
how much fear had permeate
my existence for a year.

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:58.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. And, you know,
within this pandemic, of, like

00:03:58.504 --> 00:04:02.475
being afraid of this imaginary
monster that wasn't imaginary,

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:08.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
but we couldn't see it,
was also...a lot of violence

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:11.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
a racial reckoning,
so, like, my nervous system,

00:04:11.484 --> 00:04:15.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's -- I'm in this process of
trying to calm myself down

00:04:15.021 --> 00:04:18.191
which I think is important
for all of us to acknowledge

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:19.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I keep trying
to have deep compassion

00:04:19.993 --> 00:04:22.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
for other people and myself.
-I think that is a --

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:23.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
If that's the takeaway
of the last year,

00:04:23.997 --> 00:04:25.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
that would be
a very good takeaway.

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:30.136
I am also happy to see that yo
took that step, that big step,

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:32.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
of getting on an airplane.
-I did, yes.

00:04:32.272 --> 00:04:36.843
-Taking a trip out of L.A.
And I wanted to show a video

00:04:36.843 --> 00:04:39.445
This is someone who's mayb
not traveled for a while.

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:43.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe forgot how you're
supposed to dress for a plane.

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:46.786 size:84% position:42%
-Also, somebody who was
genuinely locked down.

00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:48.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was a genuine
lockdown person.

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:51.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did not go to the market
I did not go anywhere.

00:04:51.357 --> 00:04:53.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
I really did not
see anyone at all.

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:56.663
And I'm single and alone,
so it was, you know...

00:04:56.663 --> 00:04:59.065 align:start size:94% position:6%
So going out into the worl
with other people,

00:04:59.065 --> 00:05:01.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wanted to be prepared
and safe, Seth.

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:03.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wanted to be
prepared and safe!

00:05:03.736 --> 00:05:06.239
-Well, let's take a look
at how you went about it.

00:05:06.239 --> 00:05:08.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here's Tracee.
And there she is,

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:14.814
wearing a full helmet, wit
a mask on inside the helmet.

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:17.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
So, to be clear,

00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:21.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
air filtration system
in the helmet, double mask

00:05:21.921 --> 00:05:25.625
and that was in case I needed to
go to the bathroom on the plan

00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:27.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I wanted
to be extra safe.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:30.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
I also wiped down my seat,
put a seat cover,

00:05:30.063 --> 00:05:33.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
and had an air purifier
I was also holding.

00:05:33.599 --> 00:05:35.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Clears throat ]
But I'm fine.

00:05:35.902 --> 00:05:40.440
-Do you think people were
looking at you strangely?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.608 size:75% position:38%
Or was it impossible
to see their faces

00:05:42.608 --> 00:05:44.677 line:92%
through everything you had on?

00:05:44.677 --> 00:05:48.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, Seth,
other people's opinion of me

00:05:48.114 --> 00:05:49.415 line:92%
was not my first priority.

00:05:49.415 --> 00:05:52.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
My priority was my safety
and my comfort level.

00:05:52.418 --> 00:05:55.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, therefore,
I took all precautions

00:05:55.188 --> 00:05:57.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
and let other people's
points of view,

00:05:57.123 --> 00:06:00.093
judgment, and shaming --
left those to themselves.

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:02.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
-May they have
the same compassion for yo

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:06.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you have for them, Tracee
-That's right, Seth!

00:06:06.466 --> 00:06:08.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right.
[ Both laugh ]

00:06:08.735 --> 00:06:11.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, how have --
Do you feel --

00:06:11.738 --> 00:06:12.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean,
are you seeing friends yet

00:06:12.939 --> 00:06:15.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you feel like
you've forgotten how to be -

00:06:15.742 --> 00:06:17.777 size:88% position:44%
Because I know you to be
a very gregarious person

00:06:17.777 --> 00:06:20.747 size:84% position:42%
in public and certainly
in social situations.

00:06:20.747 --> 00:06:23.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
Has that come back?
Is it like riding a bike?

00:06:23.316 --> 00:06:25.885 line:92%
Or do you feel that it's rusty

00:06:25.885 --> 00:06:27.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's rusty.
-Yeah.

00:06:27.186 --> 00:06:27.887 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-I'm definitely rusty.

00:06:27.887 --> 00:06:31.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I took two steps forward
one step back.

00:06:31.157 --> 00:06:34.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
So what I have found is,
I'm still a person who will --

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:37.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have no shame about
putting my mask back on.

00:06:37.964 --> 00:06:38.765 line:92%
You know, even if we're outside.

00:06:38.765 --> 00:06:41.968
I'm like, if it makes me fee
more comfortable, put it on.

00:06:41.968 --> 00:06:45.772
I miss my friends, but I -
it's also, like, a process

00:06:45.772 --> 00:06:48.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because I find that
it's the aftermath

00:06:48.207 --> 00:06:49.142 line:92%
that's the most difficult.

00:06:49.142 --> 00:06:51.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm fine while I'm in it.
And then, I get home,

00:06:51.711 --> 00:06:56.015
and I'm like, "That was so
reckless and irresponsible!"

00:06:56.015 --> 00:06:58.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now, you know --
And I was not.

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:01.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
As you can tell,
I take things quite seriously.

00:07:01.287 --> 00:07:03.523 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Both laugh ]

00:07:03.523 --> 00:07:05.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You --
This is really incredible.

00:07:05.858 --> 00:07:07.160 line:92%
This is eight seasons of a show.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
In any area --
any era, excuse me --

00:07:09.328 --> 00:07:12.965
of television, eight seasons
is an incredible accomplishment.

00:07:12.965 --> 00:07:15.501
Here's a photo -- I mostly
want to show this photo --

00:07:15.501 --> 00:07:16.302 line:92%
it's the show over the years

00:07:16.302 --> 00:07:18.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it's also Anthony's bear
over the years.

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:22.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which is really --
-Yeah, so we -- on the 18th --

00:07:22.341 --> 00:07:23.109 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, look at this.

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:27.079
On the 18th is our season finale
of season seven.

00:07:27.079 --> 00:07:29.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I can't believe
seven years has gone by.

00:07:29.882 --> 00:07:33.219
But at the same time, I have
the marker of Anthony's beard.

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:34.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And I will tell you that,

00:07:34.387 --> 00:07:37.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
while we shot
during the pandemic, Anthony

00:07:37.723 --> 00:07:40.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
because of the beard,
his mask would,

00:07:40.326 --> 00:07:43.863
during rehearsal, start to
creep into his eyeballs.

00:07:43.863 --> 00:07:45.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-Because the mask --

00:07:45.531 --> 00:07:49.669 size:84% position:42%
There was no way to get
a mask over the beard.

00:07:49.669 --> 00:07:51.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"Anthony, can you see?"

00:07:51.537 --> 00:07:53.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
"No. But I'm being safe."
[ Laughs ]

00:07:53.539 --> 00:07:57.810
-Well, that -- Again, certainly,
that is to be valued

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:59.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
over the course
of this last year.

00:07:59.812 --> 00:08:02.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is so wonderful to see you,
Tracee.

00:08:02.315 --> 00:08:05.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
I hope next time,
one, either you're here,

00:08:05.351 --> 00:08:09.355
or, two, we see yet another room
of your beautiful home.

00:08:09.355 --> 00:08:11.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I would hope to be with you
in person, Seth.

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:14.994
-Let's aim for that instead.
The season finale of "Black-ish"

00:08:14.994 --> 00:08:18.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
airs next Tuesday,
May 18th, on ABC.

